  "description": "Immerse yourself in the vibrant world of K-pop and discover 12 talented girls who dream of fame.\n\nEach one has her own personality, aspirations, and style, but they all share one goal: to shine on stage.\n\nCan you make them fall for you before their big debut takes them away forever?\n\n\nGame Features:\n\n● 12 girls, 12 unique styles: From the sweet and shy girl to the explosive diva, each aspiring idol has her own charm and challenges. Discover what makes them tick and how to win their hearts.\n\n● Dynamic conversations and strategic flirting: Talk to them, send messages, earn their trust, and plan the perfect date. Will you be their number one fan or the love of their life?\n\n● Affinity meter: Your choices will influence how they feel about you. Can you make their hearts beat to the rhythm of your words?\n\n● Multiple endings: Will you win over your favourite girl, or will you end up in the dreaded friend zone? Every decision leads to a different story.\n\n● 30 days to conquer stardom (and their hearts): Time is running out. Every interaction and every word matters.\n\n\nDo you have what it takes to steal the hearts of future K-pop queens and become their inspiration?\n\nFind out in this adventure filled with romance, music, and unexpected twists!",
